+## 12. Session 14 — the review's findings, checked one by one
+
+An external review of PR #923 raised one blocking correctness finding and a set
+of quality findings. Each was verified against the tree rather than accepted;
+one was worse than reported, two did not reproduce, and the rest stood.
+
+### 12.1 B1 — `_mm_cvtsd_si32` did not link. Confirmed, worse than reported.
+Both the mnemonic-table entry and the emitter arm were missing, so every user
+of `_mm_cvtsd_si32` failed at link. The cause was mine: a merge-conflict
+resolution removed duplicate `match` arms by *line number*, and the deleted
+range took `cvtsd2si128`/`CvtSd2Si128` with it while leaving its `cvtt`
+sibling duplicated — the file then still compiled, and 5744 unit tests still
+passed, because the contract that broke is only observable when a translation
+unit *links*. Restored in both tables, in the canonical order.
+
+The class, not the instance, is now closed by two new gates:
+
+* `every_header_declared_lccc_simd_symbol_resolves` (Rust unit test): parses the
+  generated header, derives each symbol's mnemonic exactly as `lower_lccc_simd`
+  does, and requires the lookup to resolve it. No hand-maintained list, so a
+  newly declared symbol cannot be forgotten.
+* `tests/regression/check_lccc_simd_completeness.py`: generates a TU that
+  *calls* all 264 declared symbols and requires it to compile and link. This is
+  the property users depend on and it catches what a static check cannot: that
+  the emitter actually emits the code.
+
+### 12.2 The two remaining dead symbols were not dead — and GCC had removed them
+The static cross-check found `_mm512_cmpeq_epi8/epi16` declared with no lowering.
+Checking further, all eight mask-less 512-bit compares are broken: AVX-512
+encodes an integer compare only with a mask destination, so `vpcmpeqb %zmm` does
+not exist and there is no single-instruction lowering for a full-vector result.
+GCC 10+ and current Clang **removed** the whole family, and the host GCC 16.2-era
+behaviour confirms it (`error: implicit declaration of function
+'_mm512_cmpeq_epi8'`).
+
+So lccc was advertising eight intrinsics that could not be assembled. Fixed the
+way the ecosystem did: removed them from the generator (never from the generated
+header), and added the four missing `_mm512_cmpgt_epi{8,16,32,64}_mask` forms so
+the signed compares the removal takes away are still available in the modern
+spelling. The `Pcmpeq*512`/`Pcmpgt*512` op variants and their emitter arms --
+which could only ever produce an unencodable instruction -- are deleted.
+
+### 12.3 TODO-13 closed: the scalar-double gap was a header problem
+The review's static matrix said the scalar rows were the worst (`maxsd` 86 vs 11
+best-oracle). The emitter was not at fault: `_mm_add_sd` and friends were written
+as C struct arithmetic, so each call copied the 16-byte aggregate through memory
+and the compare became `ucomisd`+`cmov`. Measured on the current tree, `add_sd`
+cost 80 instructions where the arithmetic itself is one `addsd`.
+
+Fixed with one immediate-selected builtin for the whole family
+(`ScalarFpLane128`: 0..=6 doubles, 8..=14 singles) instead of thirteen new
+opcodes -- thirteen would have meant thirteen entries in every dispatch table,
+which is the duplication that produced B1. Header wrappers are one line each.
+
+```text
+row          before   after   gcc (best oracle)
+maxsd            84      37        11
+minsd            82      37        11
+sqrtsd           85      25        11
+addss/subss/...  59      37        ...
+sqrtss           28      25        ...
+matrix total   3230    2812      1443  (-13% on LCCC's own count)
+```
+
+Correctness is not argued, it is measured: `sse2_scalar_fp_lane_semantics.c`
+compares 2381 lane bit patterns against GCC for the 14 intrinsics over 14
+awkward inputs each -- NaN in either operand, `+0.0` against `-0.0` both ways,
+denormals, infinities, `sqrt(-x)` -- and is bit-identical at `-O0`, `-O1`,
+`-O2`, `-O3` and `-Os`. The gate records that as a hash so it is
+host-independent, and runs the GCC differential when an oracle is present.
+
+What remains (TODO-15) is not the arithmetic: the body is 6 instructions when
+the builtin is called directly, and the extra 30 are two redundant slot-to-slot
+`movdqu` pairs from by-value aggregate parameter passing plus a 248-byte frame.
+That is the vector ABI (TODO-5); a standalone probe with
+`__attribute__((vector_size(16)))` produces 25 instructions for the same loop,
+which is the size of the prize.
+
+### 12.4 Where the review did not reproduce
+* **The AArch64 frame red is main-side.** 96 bytes/62 instructions at base
+  `c8e9226bb`, 128/101 on main `eeece44e9`, 96/95 with `CCC_DISABLE_PASSES=all`.
+  The gate stays exact on the band contract; only the absolute pin moves.
+* **The hot-web narrowing emits no different byte** on any corpus program, and
+  the mechanism witness cannot exist on today's allocator (the hot candidates
+  are already assigned). Recorded rather than waived, with the gate's assertion
+  replaced by the structural contract.
+* **`aggcopy16` compile-time**: measured indirectly -- `-O2` over the 70-program
+  corpus is 3.7 s total, so there is no observable time cost to chase. A
+  dedicated on/off wall-time measurement on a large TU remains open.
+
