+| TODO-17 | `__builtin_clear_padding` | needs per-type padding ranges; no infrastructure exists to enumerate padding bytes |
+| TODO-19 | — | **closed**: the 14 `__builtin_stdc_*` are implemented and `__has_builtin` answers 1 truthfully, so `<stdbit.h>` now takes the builtin path instead of its macro fallback |
